# Production build (incl. native iOS/Android): there is no Vite dev proxy, so the
# app must hit the Cloud Run API directly at its absolute URL. CORS is sidestepped
# on native by CapacitorHttp (see capacitor.config.ts), which routes fetch through
# the native HTTP layer. `npm run build` loads this file (production mode) and
# overrides the relative /api in .env.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://bodega-api-213688091030.us-east1.run.app
